Subject: Connect four original static material programs to native GX

Upstream-base: 2c71062ca827c5d2115ab76f4da80aaa8c515ff8

Use typed Aurora headers, bounded native float vertex arrays, indexed FIFO API
calls and GXEnd. Retain original TEV recipes, parameters and alpha preparation.
Select the existing unlit branches in an explicitly scoped diagnostic context;
real stadium lighting/shadow branches stay console-only until their services
are ported. Use the preview camera/time and safe quantized texture scrolling.
Reset class lifecycle state and resolve scrolling wrap before texture binding.

